 * 2. 假突破识别逻辑（tpct≥8% + v<1.5）准确触发
 * 3. 8 种风格 × 5 级能量全覆盖
 * 
 * 运行：npx vitest run src/services/scoring/v6-engine/calculators/breakout-walkthrough.test.ts
